# Leave blank for the local Vite proxy or same-origin Pages Functions.
# Set only when the API is hosted separately.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# Never put owner passwords or other secrets in a Vite environment variable.
# The Worker/Pages server defaults to DEMO_MODE=true and accepts only fictional
# @example.invalid contacts. Keep DEMO_MODE=true for any public portfolio demo.
# Server-only optional binding: WEBHOOK_SECRET (32+ characters).
# Put it in ignored .dev.vars for local tests or a protected Wrangler secret in production.
